The '''music''' in ''The Binding of Isaac: Rebirth'', ''[[Afterbirth]]'', ''[[Afterbirth †]]'', and ''[[Repentance]]'' was created by Ridiculon. These soundtracks can be purchased on [https://store.steampowered.com/app/322660/The_Binding_of_Isaac_Rebirth__Soundtrack/ Steam] and on [https://ridiculon.bandcamp.com/ Ridiculon's Bandcamp page], as well as being [https://open.spotify.com/artist/3nR7YC6thZ34eER6R6jAta?si=AtUpNA-RQ6mCdll5CBfKFQ available on Spotify], containing 32, 9, 4, and 20 tracks, respectively. Not all tracks heard in-game are included in the OST releases, and some tracks in the OST do not appear in-game or go unused.

Most main floor tracks have a heavier variant that plays when enough enemies or bosses are in the room. In the OST, these variants are generally heard in each song’s second half. What instrument is added is listed next to each track's name in square brackets.

